---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const lastUpdated = '27 August 2026';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="UroRef privacy policy — what data we collect, why, and your rights.">

  <section class="u-hero" style="padding: 5rem 1.5rem 4rem;">
    <div class="u-hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="u-hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div style="max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative;">
      <div class="u-eyebrow-pill" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="u-gradient-text" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Privacy</h1>
      <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-size: 1rem; margin: 0;">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 5rem; max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <article class="legal">

      <p>
        UroRef is built by Nity G (ST5 Urology Registrar, North West Deanery). This page explains what
        information the UroRef website (uroref.com) and the UroRef mobile app collect, why,
        and what your rights are. We aim for the absolute minimum.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Data controller: Nity G, trading as UroRef. Contact via the
        <a href="https://forms.gle/4QTK3MSgMsedJQEw7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">feedback form</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What this website collects</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No account, no login.</strong> The public website does not require an account.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Private site search.</strong> Pagefind processes a downloaded static index in your
          browser. Search text is not added to result URLs or sent to an analytics service.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics are disabled by default.</strong> The site can be connected to an approved
          Umami installation for limited, aggregate measurement. It will not be enabled until its
          hosting, retention, consent position and event list are agreed. Search text, free text,
          patient details and session replay must not be collected.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Feedback form</strong> — if you submit our Google feedback form, the data goes to
          Google Forms under their privacy policy. We use it only to improve UroRef.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Ask Ariadne and connected features</h2>
      <p>
        The Ask Ariadne panel in the public showcase is fixed demonstration copy: it does not send
        the example question to a model or external service. A future live feature would require an
        internet connection and would transmit the text entered to an approved service. It remains
        gated until the provider, purpose, controller roles, data location, retention and deletion
        arrangements are disclosed where the feature is used and the safety evaluation is complete.
      </p>
      <p>
        Do not enter patient-identifiable or confidential information into Ariadne, site search,
        feedback forms or any demonstration. Ariadne is an educational navigation aid, not a
        patient-specific decision tool.
      </p>

      <h2>What the mobile app collects</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>No personal account.</strong> The app works offline and does not require a login.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Crash + diagnostic data</strong> through the platform (Apple / Google) so we can
          fix issues. Collection and retention depend on your platform settings and the relevant
          Apple or Google terms.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Pins and favourites stay local.</strong> These preferences are stored on your phone.
          Connected features and external source links require internet access and send the request
          to the relevant service; never enter patient-identifiable information.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        UroRef does not set tracking cookies by default. If approved Umami measurement is enabled,
        it will use its cookieless mode. External services you choose to open may apply their own
        policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Hosting — the static site host receives ordinary web-request information needed to serve the site.</li>
        <li>Google Fonts — the browser may request Geist, Source Serif 4 and JetBrains Mono from Google; system fonts provide an offline fallback.</li>
        <li>Google Forms — for feedback collection.</li>
        <li>Apple and Google — for app distribution and any platform diagnostics you permit.</li>
        <li>Umami — optional aggregate site measurement, currently disabled unless explicitly configured.</li>
        <li>A live Ariadne provider — only after the in-product disclosure and governance gate described above.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under UK GDPR you have rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability
        and objection. To exercise any of these, contact us via the feedback form. We respond
        within one month, subject to the circumstances allowed by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy materially changes, the "last updated" date above will change and the
        change will be noted on the <a href="/updates">Updates</a> page.
      </p>

      <p class="legal-foot">
        UroRef is a quick reference tool, not a substitute for clinical judgement. Always
        verify against your trust guidelines and seek senior advice where appropriate.
      </p>

    </article>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.75;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .legal h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 2.25rem 0 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .legal p, .legal ul { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    .legal ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .legal a {
      color: var(--teal-500);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }
    .legal a:hover { color: var(--teal-400); }
    .legal strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }
    .legal-foot {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      background: var(--navy-700);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--r-md);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }
  </style>

</Base>
